  "demoDataNote": "Fictional catalogues, prices, contacts and media are local demonstration data. Never reuse the demo database, identities or grants in a customer environment. A customer environment requires its own data, authority, policies, restricted connections and qualified provider bindings. The owned demo seed populates catalog_products, catalog_skus, price_lists, price_entries and the fictional acquisition address-reference registry at install with the install connection in a database explicitly marked as a demonstration. Never seed clients, stock, settings, renewal terms or method states; use their native writers.",
